{
 "SWE-Ladder: Localize, Reproduce, then Patch · REAL Lab Blog": "SWE-Ladder: Localize, Reproduce, then Patch · REAL Lab 博客",
 "SWE-Ladder shows a frozen teacher only the slice of the verified repair that the current stage needs, and introduces localization, reproduction and patching in repair order. Qwen3-4B on SWE-bench Verified: 9.6% → 16.4% pass@1.": "SWE-Ladder 在每一步仅向冻结的教师模型提供参考修复中当前阶段所需的部分，并按定位、复现、修补的顺序逐级引入各阶段。Qwen3-4B 在 SWE-bench Verified 上的 pass@1 由 9.6% 提升至 16.4%。",
 "Show the teacher only what the current repair stage needs, one stage at a time: 9.6% → 16.4% pass@1 on SWE-bench Verified with a 4B model.": "教师每次仅可见当前修复阶段所需的信息，各阶段依次训练。4B 模型在 SWE-bench Verified 上的 pass@1 由 9.6% 提升至 16.4%。",
 "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">Blog</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>November 15, 2026</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Code agents · Reinforcement learning</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>12 min read</span>": "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">博客</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>2026 年 11 月 15 日</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>代码智能体 · 强化学习</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>阅读约 12 分钟</span>",
 "A software-engineering agent has to find the bug, reproduce it and fix it, but its training signal usually comes from one test result at the end. SWE-Ladder gives a frozen teacher only the slice of the verified repair that the current stage needs, and climbs the stages in repair order.": "软件工程智能体需要定位 bug、复现故障并完成修复，但训练信号通常只有最终的一次测试结果。SWE-Ladder 将经过验证的参考修复拆分，每个阶段仅向冻结的教师模型提供相应部分，并按修复顺序逐级训练。",
 "<sup>1</sup>Zhejiang University": "<sup>1</sup>浙江大学",
 "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.33667\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>Paper</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/SWE-Ladder\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>Code</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/SWE-Ladder/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18\"></path></svg>Project page</a>": "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.33667\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>论文</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/SWE-Ladder\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>代码</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/SWE-Ladder/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18\"></path></svg>项目主页</a>",
 "<a href=\"#problem\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>What one reward misses</a>": "<a href=\"#problem\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>结果奖励的局限</a>",
 "<a href=\"#router\">Routing steps to stages</a>": "<a href=\"#router\">步骤的阶段划分</a>",
 "<a href=\"#evidence\">Stage-specific evidence</a>": "<a href=\"#evidence\">分阶段证据</a>",
 "<a href=\"#schedule\">Climbing in repair order</a>": "<a href=\"#schedule\">按修复顺序逐级训练</a>",
 "<a href=\"#climb\"><span class=\"n\">4</span>Along the ladder</a>": "<a href=\"#climb\"><span class=\"n\">4</span>逐级训练中的行为变化</a>",
 "<a href=\"#ablations\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>What matters</a>": "<a href=\"#ablations\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>消融实验</a>",
 "<a href=\"#dynamics\"><span class=\"n\">6</span>Training dynamics</a>": "<a href=\"#dynamics\"><span class=\"n\">6</span>训练动态</a>",
 "<a href=\"#problem\">What one reward misses</a>": "<a href=\"#problem\">结果奖励的局限</a>",
 "<a href=\"#climb\">Along the ladder</a>": "<a href=\"#climb\">逐级训练中的行为变化</a>",
 "<a href=\"#dynamics\">Training dynamics</a>": "<a href=\"#dynamics\">训练动态</a>",
 "Resolving a repository issue takes three skills: <span class=\"st-loc\">localize</span> the faulty code, <span class=\"st-rep\">reproduce</span> the failure, and <span class=\"st-patch\">patch</span> the code. Reinforcement learning trains all three from a single test result on the final patch. On-policy self-distillation adds a teacher that sees privileged evidence, but in practice it is shown the full reference patch at every step, which tells it <em>what</em> to change even while the agent is still working out <em>where</em> to look.": "解决代码仓库中的 issue 需要三种能力：<span class=\"st-loc\">定位</span>出错代码、<span class=\"st-rep\">复现</span>故障、<span class=\"st-patch\">修补</span>代码。强化学习仅依据最终补丁的一次测试结果同时训练这三种能力。On-policy 自蒸馏引入了可获取特权证据的教师，但通常在每一步都向教师提供完整的参考补丁：智能体尚在确定应查看<em>何处</em>时，教师已知道应修改<em>什么</em>。",
 "SWE-Ladder splits the verified repair of each training issue into three pieces of evidence: the changed files and lines for localization, the fail-to-pass tests for reproduction, and the diff for patching. A rule-based router labels every step of an end-to-end rollout with its stage from the tool call, a frozen teacher sees only the matching evidence, and the stages are distilled one at a time in repair order while GRPO keeps optimizing the whole trajectory.": "SWE-Ladder 将每个训练 issue 经过验证的参考修复拆分为三份证据：定位阶段使用改动的文件与行号，复现阶段使用 fail-to-pass 测试，修补阶段使用 diff。基于规则的路由器根据工具调用为端到端 rollout 的每一步标注阶段，冻结的教师仅接收对应阶段的证据。蒸馏按修复顺序每次只针对一个阶段，GRPO 则始终优化整条轨迹。",
 "<strong>With Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 on SWE-bench Verified, SWE-Ladder raises pass@1 from 9.6% to 16.4%, against 10.4% for GRPO and 12.4% for a teacher that sees the full patch.</strong> On the OpenHands scaffold it goes from 13.0% to 17.6%, where every baseline stays at or below the base model. Reversing the stage order drops it to 11.4%.": "<strong>在 SWE-bench Verified 上，SWE-Ladder 将 Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 的 pass@1 由 9.6% 提升至 16.4%，GRPO 为 10.4%，使用完整补丁的教师为 12.4%。</strong>在 OpenHands 框架下，SWE-Ladder 由 13.0% 提升至 17.6%，而所有基线均未超过基座模型。若颠倒阶段顺序，结果降至 11.4%。",
 "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">SWE-bench Verified, R2E-Gym, pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">Beats both kinds of supervision</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">SWE-bench Verified, OpenHands, pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">Holds on a second scaffold</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#ablations\"><p class=\"card-k\">Training order, pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">The order of the rungs matters</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">R2E-Gym, trajectories that finish</p><p class=\"card-t\">Shorter, and almost always complete</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>": "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">SWE-bench Verified，R2E-Gym，pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">优于两类监督方式</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">SWE-bench Verified，OpenHands，pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">在第二种框架下依然有效</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#ablations\"><p class=\"card-k\">训练顺序，pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">阶段顺序影响显著</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">R2E-Gym，轨迹完成率</p><p class=\"card-t\">步数更少，轨迹几乎全部完成</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>",
 "<span class=\"n\">1</span>What one reward, or one full patch, misses": "<span class=\"n\">1</span>结果奖励与完整补丁的局限",
 "An SWE agent edits a repository over dozens of tool calls, and the usual training signal is whether its final patch passes the designated tests. That makes it hard to tell which decision caused a failure. To see what different signals actually teach, we measure three intermediate behaviours on SWE-bench Verified alongside pass@1: whether the agent edits the files changed by the reference repair (<em>localization</em>), whether it writes and runs a script that shows the failure (<em>reproduction</em>), and whether it re-runs that script successfully after its last edit (<em>verification</em>).": "SWE 智能体修复一个仓库需调用数十次工具，而常用的训练信号仅取决于最终补丁能否通过指定测试，因此难以判断失败源于哪一步决策。为分析不同信号实际训练出的能力，本文在 SWE-bench Verified 上除 pass@1 外还统计三种中间行为。<em>定位</em>：智能体是否修改了参考修复所改动的文件。<em>复现</em>：是否编写并运行脚本以重现故障。<em>验证</em>：最后一次修改后是否重新运行该脚本且运行成功。",
 "Two patterns stand out. <strong>The outcome reward does not reliably improve these behaviours:</strong> under GRPO, pass@1 barely moves, from 9.6% to 10.4%, while reproduction falls from 59.4% to 48.6%. <strong>Showing the teacher the full patch raises pass@1 but lowers post-edit verification</strong>, from 22.6% to 16.2%. During a localization step, a teacher that already sees the replacement code is pulled toward editing rather than searching; the same effect has been reported in single-turn reasoning, where a teacher conditioned on the full reference makes the student skip intermediate steps and verify less.": "实验呈现两个规律。<strong>结果奖励无法稳定改善上述行为：</strong>经 GRPO 训练后，pass@1 仅由 9.6% 升至 10.4%，复现率则由 59.4% 降至 48.6%。<strong>向教师提供完整补丁可提高 pass@1，但会减少修改后的验证</strong>，验证率由 22.6% 降至 16.2%。在定位步骤中，教师已看到修改后的代码，因而倾向于直接编辑而非继续搜索。单轮推理任务中也有相同现象的报道：以完整参考答案为条件的教师会使学生跳过中间步骤，验证也随之减少。",
 "The idea": "核心思路",
 "At each step, the teacher should see only the part of the verified repair that the current stage needs, and the stages should be taught in the order a repair uses them: find the code, make the failure concrete, then fix it.": "每一步仅向教师提供参考修复中当前阶段所需的部分，各阶段按修复过程中的使用顺序依次训练：先定位代码，再复现故障，最后完成修复。",
 "SWE-Ladder trains a single end-to-end agent. It never constrains which tools the agent calls; it only decides which evidence the teacher sees and which tokens that teacher supervises. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">Figure 1</a> plays a real 21-step rollout from the paper through the router, then climbs the three phases of training.": "SWE-Ladder 训练的是单个端到端智能体。该方法不限制智能体调用的工具，仅决定两件事：教师可见的证据，以及教师监督的 token。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">图 1</a> 以论文中一条真实的 21 步 rollout 演示路由器的标注过程，并依次展示三个训练阶段。",
 "Student rollout · an oauthlib issue, 21 steps, labelled by the router": "学生 rollout · oauthlib 的一个 issue，共 21 步，阶段由路由器标注",
 "<span class=\"m2-test\">tests</span><span>One verifier result for the whole rollout → <b>GRPO updates every response token</b>, whatever its stage.</span>": "<span class=\"m2-test\">测试</span><span>整条 rollout 仅有一个验证结果 → <b>GRPO 更新全部回复 token</b>，不区分阶段。</span>",
 "<b>Phase 3 · PATCH</b><span>iterations 51–70</span>": "<b>阶段 3 · PATCH</b><span>第 51–70 轮迭代</span>",
 "<b>Phase 2 · REP</b><span>iterations 31–50</span>": "<b>阶段 2 · REP</b><span>第 31–50 轮迭代</span>",
 "<b>Phase 1 · LOC</b><span>iterations 1–30</span>": "<b>阶段 1 · LOC</b><span>第 1–30 轮迭代</span>",
 "Frozen teacher · same base model · sees only": "冻结教师 · 与学生共用基座模型 · 仅可见",
 "Choose a phase": "选择阶段",
 "Distillation mask on the rollout": "rollout 上的蒸馏掩码",
 "L = L<sub>GRPO</sub> + 0.15 · L<sub>OPSD</sub>(<span id=\"m2-loss\">active stage</span>)": "L = L<sub>GRPO</sub> + 0.15 · L<sub>OPSD</sub>(<span id=\"m2-loss\">当前阶段</span>)",
 "<b>Figure 1.</b> SWE-Ladder on one rollout. <b>Top:</b> the 21 steps of an oauthlib repair (paper Table 7), grouped as in the paper and labelled LOC, REP or PATCH by the rule-based router from each tool call. The labels are not monotone: re-running the reproduction script while patching demotes the state to REP (step 12), and a third consecutive inspection returns it to LOC (step 15). <b>Bottom:</b> the three training phases. In each phase a frozen copy of the base model sees one stage's evidence and distils only the steps with that label; GRPO still trains on every step. Evidence blocks are the schematic examples of the paper's Figure 3.": "<b>图 1：</b>SWE-Ladder 在一条 rollout 上的工作过程。<b>上：</b>一次 oauthlib 修复的 21 个步骤，取自论文表 7，分组方式与论文一致，LOC、REP、PATCH 标签由基于规则的路由器根据每次工具调用给出。标签并非单调推进：第 12 步在修补过程中重新运行复现脚本，状态退回 REP；第 15 步连续第三次查看代码，状态回到 LOC。<b>下：</b>三个训练阶段。每个阶段由基座模型的冻结副本作为教师，仅接收一个阶段的证据，且仅蒸馏带有该标签的步骤；GRPO 仍作用于全部步骤。证据块为论文图 3 中的示意样例。",
 "Routing steps to stages": "步骤的阶段划分",
 "A deterministic, tool-level state machine labels each step. Creating or running a file whose name contains <code>repro</code>, editing a test file or running the test suite proposes <span class=\"st-rep\">REP</span>; editing any other source file proposes <span class=\"st-patch\">PATCH</span>; searches, file views and read-only shell commands are exploration. A proposal only moves the state forward in the order LOC → REP → PATCH, and backtracking depends on the state: in REP, three consecutive explorations return to LOC; in PATCH, a single test run demotes to REP and a single exploration returns to LOC. The labels only route the teacher's context and the distillation mask. They never truncate a rollout or change its reward.": "路由器是基于工具调用的确定性状态机，为每一步标注阶段。创建或运行文件名含 <code>repro</code> 的文件、编辑测试文件或运行测试套件，提议切换至 <span class=\"st-rep\">REP</span>；编辑其他源文件，提议切换至 <span class=\"st-patch\">PATCH</span>；搜索、查看文件和只读 shell 命令视为探索。提议只能使状态沿 LOC → REP → PATCH 方向推进，回退规则取决于当前状态：处于 REP 时，连续三次探索即回到 LOC；处于 PATCH 时，运行一次测试即退回 REP，探索一次即回到 LOC。标签仅用于确定教师的上下文和蒸馏掩码，不会截断 rollout，也不改变奖励。",
 "On 2,261 held-out stage-labelled steps, the router agrees with reference labels on 92.0% of them. A learned TF-IDF classifier agrees on 98.63%, yet trains a worse agent: it predicts each step independently and fragments trajectories into isolated labels, while the stateful rules produce contiguous stage blocks.": "在 2,261 个留出的阶段标注步骤上，路由器与参考标签的一致率为 92.0%。经训练的 TF-IDF 分类器一致率达 98.63%，但训练出的智能体效果更差：分类器对每一步独立预测，使轨迹被切分为零散的标签，而带状态的规则产生连续的阶段块。",
 "Stage-specific evidence": "分阶段证据",
 "All evidence comes from each training issue's verified repair, with nothing generated by an external model. The teacher prompts share the student's system instructions and task prompt; only an appended evidence block differs.": "所有证据均取自训练 issue 经过验证的参考修复，不使用任何外部模型生成。教师提示词与学生共用系统指令和任务描述，仅在末尾附加一段证据。",
 "Stage": "阶段",
 "What the teacher sees": "教师可见内容",
 "Added tokens, median / mean": "新增 token 数（中位数 / 均值）",
 "changed non-test file paths, old-side hunk ranges and the pre-patch source lines, but not the replacement code": "改动的非测试文件路径、旧版本一侧的 hunk 范围及修改前的源代码行，不含替换后的代码",
 "fail-to-pass test identifiers and names, reference test code, candidate test changes when available": "fail-to-pass 测试的标识符与名称、参考测试代码，以及可获得的候选测试改动",
 "the verified repair diff": "经过验证的修复 diff",
 "all three (unrouted)": "三者全部提供，不经路由",
 "the union, as a full-reference teacher would see it": "三者的并集，即完整参考教师所见内容",
 "Climbing in repair order": "按修复顺序逐级训练",
 "Training runs 70 iterations in three phases, each continuing from the previous checkpoint: 30 for LOC, then 20 for REP, then 20 for PATCH. In each phase, the teacher, a frozen copy of the base checkpoint, is conditioned on that phase's evidence, and a top-16 token-level distillation loss is applied only to response tokens labelled with the active stage, with weight λ = 0.15. GRPO stays active on every valid response token throughout. The order follows how a repair uses the evidence: on-policy distillation only supervises states the student actually reaches, so patch evidence helps only once the student can find the code to change, and the reproduction script is what it later runs to check its patch.": "训练共 70 轮迭代，分三个阶段，每个阶段从上一阶段的检查点继续训练：LOC 30 轮，REP 20 轮，PATCH 20 轮。各阶段的教师均为基座检查点的冻结副本，以本阶段证据为条件；top-16 的 token 级蒸馏损失仅作用于标注为当前阶段的回复 token，权重 λ = 0.15。GRPO 全程作用于所有有效回复 token。该顺序与修复过程使用证据的顺序一致：on-policy 蒸馏只监督学生实际到达的状态，因此学生须先能定位待修改的代码，补丁证据才能发挥作用；复现脚本则供学生此后检验补丁时运行。",
 "All methods start from Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 without task-specific supervised fine-tuning and train on 1,149 issues from SWE-smith, SWE-ReBench, R2E-Gym and SWE-Gym, with 16 tasks × 4 rollouts per iteration. We evaluate on the 500 issues of SWE-bench Verified, under the R2E-Gym scaffold and the OpenHands scaffold.": "所有方法均以 Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 为起点，未经任务相关的监督微调。训练数据为来自 SWE-smith、SWE-ReBench、R2E-Gym 和 SWE-Gym 的 1,149 个 issue，每轮迭代包含 16 个任务 × 4 条 rollout。评测使用 SWE-bench Verified 的 500 个 issue，分别在 R2E-Gym 和 OpenHands 两种智能体框架下运行。",
 "<b>Figure 2.</b> Results on two agent scaffolds (paper Table 2). <i>env_done</i> is the share of trajectories that finish before the resource limit; for average steps, lower is better. The dashed line marks the base model. GRPO+OPSD and SDAR use the same full-patch evidence as each other.": "<b>图 2：</b>两种智能体框架下的结果，数据取自论文表 2。<i>env_done</i> 为在资源上限内完成的轨迹占比；平均步数越低越好。虚线表示基座模型。GRPO+OPSD 与 SDAR 使用相同的完整补丁证据。",
 "<strong>On R2E-Gym, SWE-Ladder reaches 16.4% pass@1, against 10.4% for GRPO and 12.4% for GRPO+OPSD.</strong> It also takes fewer steps than the base model, 19.3 against 26.5, and completes 98.6% of its trajectories, whereas GRPO completes only 36.0% before the resource limit. SDAR, a gated distillation method given the same patch evidence, falls to 4.6%. On OpenHands, the three baselines end at or below the base model's 13.0% (GRPO 11.2%, GRPO+OPSD 12.4%, SDAR 6.8%), while SWE-Ladder reaches 17.6% with 16.6 steps and 99.4% completion.": "<strong>在 R2E-Gym 框架下，SWE-Ladder 的 pass@1 为 16.4%，GRPO 为 10.4%，GRPO+OPSD 为 12.4%。</strong>SWE-Ladder 的平均步数为 19.3，少于基座模型的 26.5，轨迹完成率达 98.6%；GRPO 仅有 36.0% 的轨迹在资源上限内完成。SDAR 是一种带门控的蒸馏方法，使用同样的补丁证据，pass@1 却降至 4.6%。在 OpenHands 框架下，三个基线的最终结果均不超过基座模型的 13.0%：GRPO 为 11.2%，GRPO+OPSD 为 12.4%，SDAR 为 6.8%；SWE-Ladder 达到 17.6%，平均 16.6 步，完成率 99.4%。",
 "<span class=\"n\">4</span>What changes along the ladder": "<span class=\"n\">4</span>逐级训练中的行为变化",
 "We evaluate the checkpoint at the end of each phase, LOC30, REP50 and PATCH70, and track the three behaviours together with pass@1 (<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-3\">Figure 3</a>). <strong>The LOC phase improves all four. The REP phase keeps improving localization, but reproduction and verification fall below the base model. The PATCH phase recovers both, and PATCH70 ends above the base model on all four metrics</strong>, the only method in the comparison to do so.": "本节评测各阶段结束时的检查点 LOC30、REP50 和 PATCH70，并跟踪三种中间行为与 pass@1 的变化，见<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-3\">图 3</a>。<strong>LOC 阶段使四项指标全部提升。REP 阶段定位能力继续提升，但复现与验证降至基座模型以下。PATCH 阶段使这两项回升，PATCH70 最终在四项指标上均高于基座模型</strong>，是对比方法中唯一做到这一点的方法。",
 "R2E-Gym, end of each phase": "R2E-Gym，各阶段结束时",
 "Change from the base model (percentage points)": "相对基座模型的变化（百分点）",
 "<b>Figure 3.</b> Localization, reproduction, verification and pass@1 at the base model and at the end of each phase (paper Figure 7). Base values are 33.6%, 59.4%, 22.6% and 9.6%; hover a point for the absolute value. Step through the checkpoints or press play to climb the ladder.": "<b>图 3：</b>基座模型及各阶段结束时的定位、复现、验证与 pass@1，取自论文图 7，纵轴为相对基座模型的变化。基座模型的四项指标分别为 33.6%、59.4%、22.6% 和 9.6%；鼠标悬停于数据点可查看绝对值。可逐个切换检查点，或点击“播放”依次查看各阶段。",
 "<span class=\"n\">5</span>What matters": "<span class=\"n\">5</span>消融实验：关键设计",
 "<strong>Every stage contributes, and routing alone is not enough.</strong> Removing LOC, REP or PATCH from the schedule lowers pass@1 from 16.4% to 11.2%, 13.2% or 14.0%, and every such variant falls below the base model on reproduction and verification. Removing LOC hurts most, consistent with localization being the stage the others build on. Training all three stages at once, with each routed token subset distilled from its own evidence but without the order, reaches only 12.4% and loses reproduction (35.6%) and verification (12.6%).": "<strong>每个阶段均有贡献，仅有路由并不足够。</strong>从训练计划中去掉 LOC、REP 或 PATCH，pass@1 由 16.4% 分别降至 11.2%、13.2% 和 14.0%，且这些变体的复现与验证均低于基座模型。去掉 LOC 的影响最大，这与定位是其他阶段的基础相符。若三个阶段同时训练，各路由 token 子集仍以各自证据蒸馏，但不分先后，pass@1 仅为 12.4%，复现率降至 35.6%，验证率降至 12.6%。",
 "Stage ablation, R2E-Gym": "阶段消融，R2E-Gym",
 "<span><i id=\"f4-key\" style=\"background:var(--loc)\"></i><span id=\"f4-name\">SWE-Ladder</span></span><span><i style=\"background:none;border:1.5px solid var(--b-ink);border-radius:2px;width:9px;height:9px\"></i>full SWE-Ladder, for reference</span>": "<span><i id=\"f4-key\" style=\"background:var(--loc)\"></i><span id=\"f4-name\">SWE-Ladder</span></span><span><i style=\"background:none;border:1.5px solid var(--b-ink);border-radius:2px;width:9px;height:9px\"></i>完整 SWE-Ladder，作为对照</span>",
 "<b>Figure 4.</b> Stage ablation (paper Table 3). Each variant drops one stage from the schedule, or trains all three at once; outlines mark the full SWE-Ladder. Only the full ladder improves all four metrics.": "<b>图 4：</b>阶段消融，数据取自论文表 3。每个变体从训练计划中去掉一个阶段，或将三个阶段同时训练；空心框表示完整 SWE-Ladder 的结果。仅完整的三级训练使四项指标全部提升。",
 "<strong>The order matters.</strong> With the same 30/20/20 budget, reversing the order (PATCH → REP → LOC) gives 11.4%, and putting reproduction first (REP → LOC → PATCH) gives 12.6%, even though PATCH is still last. Both also take more steps. <strong>The evidence must match the stage it supervises:</strong> with a 30-iteration budget, supervising LOC tokens with LOC evidence gives 14.4%, against 13.6% with patch evidence; supervising PATCH tokens with patch evidence gives 13.2%, against 11.8% with localization evidence, which reveals too little to write a fix.": "<strong>训练顺序影响显著。</strong>在相同的 30/20/20 迭代分配下，将顺序颠倒为 PATCH → REP → LOC，结果为 11.4%；先训练复现、顺序为 REP → LOC → PATCH 时，结果为 12.6%，尽管 PATCH 仍位于最后。这两种顺序的平均步数也更多。<strong>证据须与其监督的阶段相匹配：</strong>在 30 轮迭代的预算下，以定位证据监督 LOC token 得到 14.4%，改用补丁证据为 13.6%；以补丁证据监督 PATCH token 得到 13.2%，改用定位证据仅为 11.8%，原因是定位证据提供的信息不足以写出修复。",
 "Training order, 70 iterations": "训练顺序，共 70 轮迭代",
 "Evidence vs supervised stage, 30 iterations": "证据与监督阶段的搭配，30 轮迭代",
 "<b>Figure 5.</b> <b>Left:</b> three stage orders with the same budget (paper Table 4); average steps per trajectory are shown under each bar. <b>Right:</b> matched against swapped evidence for LOC and PATCH targets (paper Table 5).": "<b>图 5：</b><b>左：</b>相同预算下三种阶段顺序的结果，数据取自论文表 4，柱下方标注每条轨迹的平均步数。<b>右：</b>监督 LOC 与 PATCH token 时，使用对应证据与互换证据的结果对比，数据取自论文表 5。",
 "<span class=\"n\">6</span>Training dynamics": "<span class=\"n\">6</span>训练动态",
 "Comparing the first and last ten iterations, GRPO's optimization signals deteriorate: mean entropy falls from 0.0300 to 0.0061, gradient norm from 1.820 to 0.187 and training reward from 0.236 to 0.055, while responses nearly double in length, from 8.29k to 16.73k tokens. SWE-Ladder stays steadier: entropy 0.0251 → 0.0221, gradient norm 2.353 → 2.397, and responses grow modestly from 10.09k to 11.62k tokens. GRPO+OPSD and SDAR also keep optimization signal late in training, so preserved entropy or gradient magnitude alone does not explain SWE-Ladder's held-out results. These are single runs without independent seeds.": "比较训练最初 10 轮与最后 10 轮，GRPO 的优化信号明显衰退：平均熵由 0.0300 降至 0.0061，梯度范数由 1.820 降至 0.187，训练奖励由 0.236 降至 0.055，回复长度则几乎翻倍，由 8.29k 增至 16.73k token。SWE-Ladder 更为稳定：熵 0.0251 → 0.0221，梯度范数 2.353 → 2.397，回复长度仅由 10.09k 小幅增至 11.62k token。GRPO+OPSD 与 SDAR 在训练后期同样保持了优化信号，因此熵或梯度幅值得以保持，并不能单独解释 SWE-Ladder 在留出集上的结果。以上均为单次运行，未使用不同随机种子重复实验。",
 "First → last 10 iterations": "最初 10 轮 → 最后 10 轮",
 "Entropy": "熵",
 "Gradient norm": "梯度范数",
 "Response tokens": "回复 token 数",
 "Training configuration, reward shaping and the full evidence examples are in the <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.33667\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">paper</a>.": "训练配置、奖励设计和完整的证据样例见<a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.33667\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">论文</a>。",
 "A student robot climbs a ladder with LOC, REP and PATCH rungs toward a green check mark, while a frozen teacher robot holds up only a failing-test card; the localization card and a face-down patch card wait at its feet": "学生机器人沿标有 LOC、REP、PATCH 三级横档的梯子攀向绿色对勾；冻结的教师机器人手中仅举着一张失败测试卡，定位卡和一张背面朝上的补丁卡放在其脚边",
 "Router state": "路由器状态",
 "Training phases": "训练阶段",
 "Scaffold": "智能体框架",
 "Checkpoint": "检查点",
 "Variant": "变体"
}